  "files": [
    {
      "additions": 3,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/5ae43abcf2a72459ddcaadec9cc4a478a51dc921/docs%2Ffeatures%2Fdisagg_prefill.md",
      "changes": 3,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/contents/docs%2Ffeatures%2Fdisagg_prefill.md?ref=5ae43abcf2a72459ddcaadec9cc4a478a51dc921",
      "deletions": 0,
      "filename": "docs/features/disagg_prefill.md",
      "patch": "@@ -49,6 +49,9 @@ Now supports 9 types of connectors:\n   --kv-transfer-config '{\"kv_connector\":\"FlexKVConnectorV1\",\"kv_role\":\"kv_both\"}'\n   ```\n \n+!!! warning \"Hybrid model requirements\"\n+    Hybrid SSM/Mamba models require the hybrid memory allocator (HMA). `NixlConnector` and `MooncakeConnector` currently support HMA, while `LMCacheConnectorV1` and `MoRIIOConnector` do not advertise HMA support. If HMA is disabled or the selected connector does not support it, hybrid model startup will fail. For `NixlConnector`, set `VLLM_SSM_CONV_STATE_LAYOUT=DS` on every prefill and decode instance; see the [NixlConnector Compatibility Matrix](nixl_connector_compatibility.md#hybrid-ssmmamba-models).\n+\n ## Reusing prefill token ids on decode\n \n !!! note",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/raw/5ae43abcf2a72459ddcaadec9cc4a478a51dc921/docs%2Ffeatures%2Fdisagg_prefill.md",
      "sha": "e7a840951868a9f35d31425bac6805714f56b95b",
      "status": "modified"
    },
    {
      "additions": 13,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/5ae43abcf2a72459ddcaadec9cc4a478a51dc921/docs%2Ffeatures%2Fnixl_connector_compatibility.md",
      "changes": 13,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/contents/docs%2Ffeatures%2Fnixl_connector_compatibility.md?ref=5ae43abcf2a72459ddcaadec9cc4a478a51dc921",
      "deletions": 0,
      "filename": "docs/features/nixl_connector_compatibility.md",
      "patch": "@@ -98,6 +98,19 @@ By default, a **compatibility hash** is checked during handshake. P and D instan\n   resulting KV block layout is validated at handshake time rather than via the\n   compatibility hash)\n \n+### Hybrid SSM/Mamba models\n+\n+Hybrid SSM/Mamba models require the hybrid memory allocator (HMA). For hybrid\n+transfers, set `VLLM_SSM_CONV_STATE_LAYOUT=DS` on both the prefill and decode\n+instances:\n+\n+```bash\n+VLLM_SSM_CONV_STATE_LAYOUT=DS\n+```\n+\n+The `DS` layout (`dim, state_len`) is required by NixlConnector's Mamba\n+convolution-state transfer path; the default `SD` layout is not supported.\n+\n ### KV cache layout\n \n - NixlConnector defaults to **`LBHNC`** (head-major, formerly `HND`) layout for optimal transfer performance (non-MLA models).",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/raw/5ae43abcf2a72459ddcaadec9cc4a478a51dc921/docs%2Ffeatures%2Fnixl_connector_compatibility.md",
      "sha": "354ddfc43e7c1be555b9ae138dfb938fa00b6df1",
      "status": "modified"
    }
  ],
